MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An agent marks a frame it is still building (telecode_placeholder_set):
the mark is shared plugin data telecode/placeholder = {label, at}, so it
survives a reload, and the host is told about marked frames on the current
page (td-editor:placeholders) to draw a hatched "working…" badge over them.
telecode_placeholder_clear removes one mark or all of them (TeleDesign
clears every mark when the agent's turn ends); marks older than two hours
are reported stale.

Ctrl/Cmd+Enter inside the editor posts td-editor:present so the shell can
present the page's frame slides.
